{"t":"Northport","s":"northport-baaba","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Northport_16c5c4.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Northport</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Northport\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"286\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Northport_16c5c4.gif\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibian%20Explorer%20Society\">Explorer's Society</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Cave\">The Cave</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-outfits-quest\">Barbarian Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-explorer-society-quest\">The Explorer Society Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-isle-of-evil-quest\">The Isle of Evil Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.2<br/>June 10, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><b>Northport</b> is located north-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> and west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>. It is a small village known for its <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">fish</a>. Ask <a href=\"#/wiki/Marlene\">Marlene</a> about the rumours of the village. Northport may sound a remote deserted place, but it can be handy when hunting Chickens for the <a href=\"#/quest/citizen-outfits-quest\">addon quest</a>, for fishing or for a